license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/ijct1996/STEMI-Glycocalyx-MATLAB-codes.git
abstract: >
  MATLAB analysis scripts for time-of-day analyses of endothelial glycocalyx
  nanomechanics and complement activation in STEMI (time-bin box plots,
  24 h cosinor, PCA, and Spearman correlations). Patient-level data are not
  included; see the manuscript Data Availability statement.
